<title>ITALY: Gross yields mixed at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields mixed at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) and a ninth tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps, both carrying an 8.25 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   July 1,1999	Pvs    July 1,2001    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 7.21 pct    7.24 pct    7.59 pct     7.58 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     8.27 pct    8.31 pct    8.68 pct     8.67 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.35	 100.25	99.00	 99.00</p>
<p> Bids	     5.603 trln lire	  4.269 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.500 trln lire	  2.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on August 20 of a seventh tranche of three and five-year Btps.</p>
</text>
